────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
item invite        carolcopied@qq11-ww22-ee33-rr44  5m ago                      
     friend invite (first contact)                                              
  ┌─ Always deliver ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  
  │ Always deliver messages from dave@pq23-oo34-ii45-uu56?                   │  
  │ Check the fingerprint with them, out of band: pq23-oo34-ii45-uu56        │  
  │ Their messages then reach sessions that approve their own tool calls     │  
  │ without the hold.                                                        │  
  │ Trust only skips the hold: their messages are still their words, never   │  
  │ your instructions.                                                       │  
  │                                                                          │  
  │ To trust them, type the fingerprint's first four characters (pq23) and   │  
  │ press Enter. Esc cancels.                                                │  
  │                                                                          │  
  │ > ▏                                                                      │  
  │ Enter confirm Esc cancel                                                 │  
  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  
                                                                                
                                                                                
